<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear that you were moved to a different cabin on our QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} flight.<br />
<br />
I understand how disappointing this must have been for you and would like to apologise for the inconvenience caused.<br />
<br />
I’ve arranged a refund for you as detailed below.<br />
<br />
Refund Amount: {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}}<br />
This is calculated as: <strong>XX</strong>% of the original ticket price, which was $<strong>XX</strong>.<br />
<br />
This will be refunded to the original form of payment.<br />
<br />
Most refunds are processed within 7 days, however, can take up to 28 days depending on your financial institution.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If Ex-Gratia voucher provided add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
We want to let you know that we’ve arranged a Qantas Customer Care travel voucher for &lt;<strong>amount</strong>&gt; for you to use towards your next booking with us, you will receive this in another email. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Once again, I apologise for the inconvenience caused.&nbsp;</p>
